 Statement</a></li><li><a class="" href="/contact-us">Contact us</a></li></ul><div class="legal-list_copyright"><p>© The Economist Newspaper Limited <!-- -->2026</p><p>Registered in England and Wales. No. 236383 | Registered office: The Adelphi, 1-11 John Adam Street, London, WC2N 6HT | VAT Reg No: GB 340 436 876</p></div></div></div></div></nav></div></header><div data-key="0"><main class="page page--TemplateLanding entry--Page page--sticky-nav" id="main"><div class="page-header page-header--dark-text page-header--small" style="background:#EFF5F5"><div class="page-header__content container"><div class="page-header__wrapper"><h1 class="page-header__title">About us</h1></div></div></div><div class="sticky-nav "><div class="sticky-nav__content"><div class="sticky-nav__primary "><div class="sticky-nav__primary-inner"><div class="overflow"></div><span class="sticky-nav__title">Jump to</span><ul class="sticky-nav__list"><li id="nav-our-story" class="sticky-nav__item "><button tabindex="0" class="link link--formal  "><span>Our story</span></button></li><li id="nav-our-editorial-philosophy" class="sticky-nav__item "><button tabindex="0" class="link link--formal  "><span>Our editorial philosophy</span></button></li><li id="nav-our-values" class="sticky-nav__item "><button tabindex="0" class="link link--formal  "><span>Our values</span></button></li><li id="nav-our-offices-with-map" class="sticky-nav__item "><button tabindex="0" class="link link--formal  "><span>Our offices</span></button></li></ul></div></div><div class="sticky-nav__secondary" style="position:relative"><ul class="button-list"></ul></div></div></div><div class="page-body" id="content"><section data-id="our-story" class=" section content "><div class="section-id-placeholder" id="our-story"></div><div class="section__anchor"></div><div class="section-intro
        
        section-intro--image-bottom-indent section-intro--full-image section-intro--has-display
      "><div class="section-intro__content"><div class="hero-container"><img src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h5kbjx7tvqe/5uHbKhV6LfZwWAIdNlhji1/9aa7b690163db7e037c185a339b0a913/220128-About-us-hero.jpg?h=494" title="1920x449 About-us hero" alt="Media image" style="margin:auto;display:block" class="section-image hero-desktop-image"/></div><div class="container"><div class="intro__content-wrapper"><div class="intro__header"><h2 class="intro__title false"><div>Our story</div></h2></div><div class="intro__content"><div class="intro__large"><div>Inspiring progress globally</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section__content"><div class="block block--left-align block--text container"><div class="block__content"><div class="text-block  text-block--basic"><div class="text-block__primary"><div class="rt-module"><p>From its beginnings in 1843, when <i>The Economist</i> newspaper was founded by a Scottish hat manufacturer to further the cause of free trade, The Economist Group has evolved into a staunchly independent global media and information-services company with intelligent brands for an international audience.</p><p>Over time, the newspaper has helped readers grasp the great drivers of change, from technology to geopolitics, finance and economics. It added a dedicated section on the United States in 1942 and a China section in 2012. It expanded successfully into North America, which became its largest market. To serve decision-makers in businesses and beyond, the Economist Intelligence Unit (EIU) became a leader in country analysis and forecasting. Live events around the world brought global thought-leaders together to discuss critical topics at roundtables and summits.</p><p>In recent years, the great change has been digital. The EIU started to deliver a timely stream of business intelligence and data. <i>The Economist</i> expanded its journalism online, onto its app and into podcasts, films, interactive infographics and social media. Economist Education began online executive courses, and Economist Impact grew, combining the reach and rigour of a think-tank with the creativity of a media brand to engage influential stakeholders and find new ways to pursue progress.</p><p>In 2026 The Economist Group launched Economist Enterprise, a single brand to bring together capabilities previously delivered through Economist Intelligence and Economist Impact. Economist Enterprise combines research, thought leadership, events and partnerships to help organisations navigate complexity with clarity, credibility and global reach.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block block--image-grid container"><div class="block__content"><div class="image-grid block--left-align"><div class="block block--img2-grid container"><div class="block__content"><div><div class="firstImageContainer"><img class="twiImageGeedItem" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h5kbjx7tvqe/5LOxegKhVGOC1gGtZ4O6sV/5cc717ea79b49f94046d564ddb0d70a7/The-Adelphi-resized-alt.jpg" alt="grid item"/><p><b>Our editorial offices in London (Photo: Alamy)</b></p></div><div><img class="twiImageGeedItem" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h5kbjx7tvqe/2JifuqBwyJhLmi6Y8Et77V/f169ab1eb72e860bf31b12bec0ffbdc4/18430902-Newspaper-first-edition-alt-resized.jpg" alt="grid item"/><p><b>First issue published in 1843</b></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-id="our-editorial-philosophy" class=" section content "><div class="section-id-placeholder" id="our-editorial-philosophy"></div><div class="section__anchor"></div><div class="section-intro
        
        section-intro--no-image
      "><div class="section-intro__content"><div class="container"><div class="intro__header"><h2 class="intro__title false"><div>Our editorial philosophy</div></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="section__content"><div class="block block--left-align block--text container"><div class="block__content"><div class="text-block  text-block--basic"><div class="text-block__primary"><div class="rt-module"><p>Founded in 1843 to support the cause of free trade, <i>The Economist</i> continues to produce journalism of sometimes radical opinion with a reverence for facts. </p><p><b>Independence</b><br/>Editorial independence lies at the heart of <i>The Economist</i>. The constitution of the company does not permit any individual or organisation to gain a majority shareholding. The editor is appointed by trustees, who are independent of commercial, political and proprietorial influences. </p><p><b>Objectivity</b><br/><i>The Economist</i> has no by-lines. It is written anonymously because its collective voice and personality matter more than the identities of individual journalists. This ensures a continuity of tradition and consistency of view.</p><p><b>Topicality</b><br/><i>The Economist</i> constantly covers and curates the news. It publishes weekly in a magazine format and daily on its digital platforms.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-id="our-values" class=" section content "><div class="section-id-placeholder" id="our-values"></div><div class="section__anchor"></div><div class="section-intro
        
        section-intro--no-image
      "><div class="section-intro__content"><div class="container"><div class="intro__header"><h2 class="intro__title false"><div>Our values</div></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="section__content"><div class="block block--left-align block--text container"><div class="block__content"><div class="text-block  text-block--basic"><div class="text-block__primary"><div class="rt-module"><p>Our values are a collective set of beliefs and behaviours that strengthen The Economist Group&#x27;s purpose and demonstrate where we want to be as an organisation. They reflect on our mission to pursue progress for individuals, organisations and the world.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block block--left-align block--full block--text-multi text-multi__content-withoutSpacing container"><div class="block--full"><div class="text-block text-block--multi" style="background-color:#EBEDFA;padding:24px"><div class="text-block__col" style="width:100%"><h3 class="text-block-header">Independence</h3><div class="rt-module"><p>We are not bound to any party or interest and encourage exploration and free-thinking. We champion freedom, both within our organisation and around the world.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block block--left-align block--full block--text-multi text-multi__content-withoutSpacing container"><div class="block--full"><div class="text-block text-block--multi" style="background-color:#EBEDFA;padding:24px"><div class="text-block__col" style="width:100%"><h3 class="text-block-header">Integrity</h3><div class="rt-module"><p>We are bold in our efforts to uncover the truth and stand up for what we believe in. We inspire trust through our rigour, fact-checking and transparency.<br/></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block block--left-align block--full block--text-multi text-multi__content-withoutSpacing container"><div class="block--full"><div class="text-block text-block--multi" style="background-color:#EBEDFA;padding:24px"><div class="text-block__col" style="width:100%"><h3 class="text-block-header">Excellence</h3><div class="rt-module"><p>We aspire to the highest standards in all we do. We are ambitious and inquisitive in our pursuit of continuous progress and innovation.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block block--left-align block--full block--text-multi text-multi__content-withoutSpacing container"><div class="block--full"><div class="text-block text-block--multi" style="background-color:#EBEDFA;padding:24px"><div class="text-block__col" style="width:100%"><h3 class="text-block-header">Inclusivity</h3><div class="rt-module"><p>We value diversity in thought and background and encourage healthy debate with a breadth of perspectives. We treat our colleagues and customers fairly and respectfully.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block block--left-align block--full block--text-multi text-multi__content-withoutSpacing container"><div class="block--full"><div class="text-block text-block--multi" style="background-color:#EBEDFA;padding:24px"><div class="text-block__col" style="width:100%"><h3 class="text-block-header">Openness</h3><div class="rt-module"><p>We foster a collaborative and empathetic culture conducive to the interests, wit and initiative of our colleagues. New ideas are our lifeblood.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-id="our-offices-with-map" class=" section content "><div class="section-id-placeholder" id="our-offices-with-map"></div><div class="section__anchor"></div><div class="section-intro
        
        section-intro--no-image section-intro--has-display
      "><div class="section-intro__content"><div class="container"><div class="intro__header"><h2 class="intro__title false"><div>Our offices</div></h2></div><div class="intro__content"><div class="intro__large"><div>Progress, globally translated</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section__content"><div class="block block--left-align block--text container"><div class="block__content"><div class="text-block  text-block--basic"><div class="text-block__primary"><div class="rt-module"><p>The Economist Group has offices in 14 countries across the world. Our remarkable people bring a wealth of local insight to our global family, enriching our expertise.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block block--left-align block--office container"><div class="block__content"></div></div></div></section></div><div class="sticky-jump container "><button aria-label="Go back to top" class="chevron-button chevron-button--inverse" name="undefined"><svg width="16" height="10" fill="none"><path d="M14.12 10 8 3.82 1.88 10 0 8.097 8 0l8 8.097L14.12 10Z" fill="#fff"></path></svg></button></div></main></div><footer class="global-footer"><div class="global-footer__content"><div class="global-footer__primary"><div class="global-footer__footer-nav"><div class="footer-nav__col"><h2 class="footer-nav__title"><a href="/about-us">About us</a></h2><ul class="footer-nav__nav"><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/about-us#our-story">Our history</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/about-us#our-editorial-philosophy">Our structure</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/about-us#our-values">Our values</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/about-us#our-offices-with-map">Our offices</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-nav__col"><h2 class="footer-nav__title"><a href="/businesses">Businesses</a></h2><ul class="footer-nav__nav"><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/businesses/the-economist">The Economist</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/businesses#economist-enterprise">Economist Enterprise</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/businesses/economist-education">Economist Education</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-nav__col"><h2 class="footer-nav__title"><a href="/careers">Careers</a></h2><ul class="footer-nav__nav"><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/careers#belonging-and-inclusion">Belonging and inclusion</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-nav__col"><h2 class="footer-nav__title"><a href="/esg">ESG</a></h2><ul class="footer-nav__nav"><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/esg#environmental-sustainability">Sustainability</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/esg#our-communities">Social</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/esg#esg-governance">Governance</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/esg/executive-leadership">Leadership</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/esg/reports">Reports</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-nav__col"><h2 class="footer-nav__title"><a href="/results">Results</a></h2><ul class="footer-nav__nav"><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/results#reports">Annual &amp; interim results</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/results#agm-and-shareholder-calls">AGM &amp; shareholder calls</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-nav__col"><h2 class="footer-nav__title"><a href="/press-centre">Group news</a></h2><ul class="footer-nav__nav"><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/press-centre#main">Featured news</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/press-centre#content">More news</a></li><li class="footer-nav__link"><a class="" href="/press-centre#press-office">Press office</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="global-footer__secondary"><div class="legal-list_container"><ul class="legal-list"><li><a class="" href="/terms-of-use">Terms of use</a></li><li><a class="" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a></li><li><a href="/about-us#">Manage cookies</a></li><li><a class="" href="/cookies-policy">Cookie policy</a></li><li><a class="" href="/accessibility-policy">Accessibility</a></li><li><a class="" href="/esg/modern-slavery-act-statement">Modern Slavery Statement</a></li><li><a class="" href="/contact-us">Contact us</a></li></ul><div class="legal-list_copyright"><p>© The Economist Newspaper Limited <!-- -->2026</p><p>Registered in England and Wales. No. 236383 | Registered office: The Adelphi, 1-11 John Adam Street, London, WC2N 6HT | VAT Reg No: GB 340 436 876</p></div></div></div></div></footer></div></div></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"dev":false,"page":{"__typename":"Page","sys":{"id":"7L31injl52nn7O6OptAOSL"},"parentPage":null,"relatedContentCollection":{"items":[]},"permission":null,"fakeParentPage":null,"title":"About us","hidePageTitle":null,"name":"About Us","theme":"Core","slug":"about-us","permalink":"/about-us","subheading":null,"isBreadcrumbs":null,"seo":{"__typename":"Seo","sys":{"id":"5JmjFsV9mdTGbB8LbyX6oA"},"image":null,"name":"About us","title":"About us","description":"From its beginnings in 1843, The Economist Group has evolved into a staunchly independent global media and information-services company with intelligent brands for an international audience.","noFollow":false,"noIndex":false},"content":{"__typename":"TemplateLanding","sys":{"id":"1XpF0NB7DffQXd6QgKwrYW"},"navCtaItemsCollection":{"items":[]},"newsSection":null,"name":"About us ","heroHeadline":"About us","heroDisplay":"Slim","heroColor":"Paris (green)","newsSectionTitle":null,"sectionsCollection":{"items":[{"__typename":"SectionBasic","sys":{"id":"3O6o8DyPoWggUya2ENTyKv"},"headline":null,"permission":null,"sectionHeadline":"Our story","slug":"our-story","mediaFullWidth":true,"fullScreenWidth":true,"blocksBackgroundColor":null,"displayHeadline":"Inspiring progress globally","dateHeadline":null,"inPageNav":true,"navigationLabel":null,"blocksCollection":{"items":[{"sys":{"id":"65ghdnBnFlyag4HdGbcPat"},"__typename":"BlockText","permission":null,"name":"Our history","headline":null,"subheadline":null,"listHeadline":null,"listItems":null,"text":{"json":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"From its beginnings in 1843, when ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"The Economist","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" newspaper was founded by a Scottish hat manufacturer to further the cause of free trade, The Economist Group has evolved into a staunchly independent global media and information-services company with intelligent brands for an international audience.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Over time, the newspaper has helped readers grasp the great drivers of change, from technology to geopolitics, finance and economics. It added a dedicated section on the United States in 1942 and a China section in 2012. It expanded successfully into North America, which became its largest market. To serve decision-makers in businesses and beyond, the Economist Intelligence Unit (EIU) became a leader in country analysis and forecasting. Live events around the world brought global thought-leaders together to discuss critical topics at roundtables and summits.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"In recent years, the great change has been digital. The EIU started to deliver a timely stream of business intelligence and data. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"The Economist","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" expanded its journalism online, onto its app and into podcasts, films, interactive infographics and social media. Economist Education began online executive courses, and Economist Impact grew, combining the reach and rigour of a think-tank with the creativity of a media brand to engage influential stakeholders and find new ways to pursue progress.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"In 2026 The Economist Group launched Economist Enterprise, a single brand to bring together capabilities previously delivered through Economist Intelligence and Economist Impact. Economist Enterprise combines research, thought leadership, events and partnerships to help organisations navigate complexity with clarity, credibility and global reach.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"links":{"assets":{"block":[]},"entries":{"hyperlink":[],"block":[]}}}},{"sys":{"id":"7E9dVTu37pZ2sWVEh9Gojp"},"__typename":"BlockImageGrid","permission":null,"itemsCollection":{"items":[{"__typename":"ComponentImage","sys":{"id":"3GnGx1jJA5tG29qLsICMll"},"imageMobile":null,"caption":{"json":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Our editorial offices in London (Photo: Alamy)","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}],"data":{}}]}},"title":null,"alt":null,"lqip":null,"image":{"url":"https://images.ctfassets.net/2h5kbjx7tvqe/5LOxegKhVGOC1gGtZ4O6sV/5cc717ea79b49f94046d564ddb0d70a7/The-Adelphi-resized-alt.jpg","height":573,"width":800,"title":"The-Adelphi-resized-alt","description":null}},{"__typename":"ComponentImage","sys":{"id":"6ZdUCAO1Ot32yyZ1C5jREl"},"imageMobile":null,"caption":{"json":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"First issue published in 1843","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}],"data":{}}]}},"title":null,"alt":null,"lqip":null,"image":{"url":"https://images.ctfassets.net/2h5kbjx7tvqe/2JifuqBwyJhLmi6Y8Et77V/f169ab1eb72e860bf31b12bec0ffbdc4/18430902-Newspaper-first-edition-alt-resized.jpg","height":927,"wi